<title>ZAIRE: Kinshasa ferry blast, at least six dead - witnesses.</title>
<headline>Kinshasa ferry blast, at least six dead - witnesses.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>An explosion on a ferry plying the river between Zaire's capital Kinshasa and neighbouring Congo killed at least six people on Tuesday, witnesses said.</p>
<p>It was not clear whether the blast, which occurred as the ferry neared the port on the Kinshasa bank of the river, was an accident or had any link with Zaire's civil war.</p>
</text>
